[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the switch on the clutch\npedal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Clutch pedal switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">I31</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the switch on the clutch pedal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021448.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the switch on the clutch pedal.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Clutch pedal switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">I31</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]